{"3560160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bearly Awesome", "steam_appid": 3560160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearly Awesome is a fun blend of action, adventure, puzzle-solving and RPG. Players control cute and cuddly bear avatars, each with unique abilities, skills and customizations in an epic journey across diverse environments. Explore the enchanting fantasy world of Snuzzleland with your unique and adorable Bearlie, collect coins and advance through fun levels! The top-down game blends exploration, puzzle-solving, light-hearted combat elements and cute characters in the ultimate furry adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-37.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_12-42-38.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearly Awesome is a sweet and joyous experience – a mix of wholesome and mischievous fun – where heaps of cute characters and exciting events await. Quest through magical lands, overcome obstacles, battle quirky enemies who wreak havoc on the forest, solve puzzles, claim new territories and eat as many snacks as you can get your paws on.<br><br>Some levels require you to be brave and resourceful, while others demand you to be quiet and sneaky as you manoeuvre around the campsite or the village without getting noticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-31.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-27-01.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-22.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-42.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_12-42-32.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_12-42-28.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Chill Game with Personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using your Bearlie’s special skills, such as moving objects with strength or being extra sneaky to traverse tricky platforms. Collect Honeycomb Coins, defeat enemies and overcome every challenge in this enchanting and whimsical world.<br><br>Simple Controls make the PC/mobile game easy to enjoy and fun to play. Some levels require you to be brave and resourceful, while others demand you to be quiet and sneaky as you manoeuvre around the campsite or the village without getting noticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/ezgif-6-d0e9f23ed4.gif?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a single level to pass a few minutes of time or immerse yourself for hours in a beautifully cozy game world with fresh new challenges for players to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearly Awesome is a fun blend of action, adventure, puzzle-solving and RPG. Players control cute and cuddly bear avatars, each with unique abilities, skills and customizations in an epic journey across diverse environments. Explore the enchanting fantasy world of Snuzzleland with your unique and adorable Bearlie, collect coins and advance through fun levels! The top-down game blends exploration, puzzle-solving, light-hearted combat elements and cute characters in the ultimate furry adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-37.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_12-42-38.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearly Awesome is a sweet and joyous experience – a mix of wholesome and mischievous fun – where heaps of cute characters and exciting events await. Quest through magical lands, overcome obstacles, battle quirky enemies who wreak havoc on the forest, solve puzzles, claim new territories and eat as many snacks as you can get your paws on.<br><br>Some levels require you to be brave and resourceful, while others demand you to be quiet and sneaky as you manoeuvre around the campsite or the village without getting noticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560160/extras/photo_2025-02-27_00-26-31.jpg?t=1774869229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn